OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANumber of asylum seekers in hotels
OL,4,Ahalves in a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said the figures showed
OL,7,Fthat policies to control migration were
OL,8,Fhaving an effect - but said there was
OL,9,Fstill more to do on the issue of small
OL,10,Fboat crossings.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
