OL,3,ACollapsed glacier likely caused
OL,4,Adevastating Nepal-Tibet floods,
OL,5,Ascientists say
OL,6,
OL,7,FPreliminary investigations have pointed
OL,8,Fto a collapsed glacier as the cause of
OL,9,Fthe flash flood on the Nepal-Tibet
OL,10,Fborder, highlighting the issue of
OL,11,Frapidly melting Himalayan ice,
OL,12,Fscientists have told the BBC.
OL,14,FInitial reports of an earthquake led
OL,15,Fmany to believe that a tremor had
OL,16,Fcaused a landslide, which in turn
OL,17,Fcaused the flood that has killed at
OL,18,Fleast 177 people.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11910
SC,0010
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1787847965
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACollapsed glacier likely caused
OL,4,Adevastating Nepal-Tibet floods,
OL,5,Ascientists say
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, the US Geological Survey then
OL,8,Fclarified that the disaster was caused
OL,9,Fby a "glacial collapse", which is when
OL,10,Fa glacier or part of a glacier
OL,11,Fdisintegrates.
OL,13,FThe impact of the collapsed glacier
OL,14,Fhitting the bottom of a valley was so
OL,15,Fpowerful that it registered a magnitude
OL,16,Fof 5.2, according to USGS data and
OL,17,Fscientists who have analysed the event.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
